          "text": [
            "A \"Facebook prompt\" can mean a few things, but most commonly it refers to a suggestion or question designed to get you thinking about what to post on Facebook to engage your audience.\n",
            "\n",
            "Here are various types of Facebook prompts, depending on your goal:\n",
            "\n",
            "---\n",
            "\n",
            "### I. General Engagement & Personal Posts (for Individuals)\n",
            "\n",
            "These are great for connecting with friends and family, and sparking conversations.\n",
            "\n",
            "1.  **Weekend Recap/Plans:**\n",
            "    *   \"What was the highlight of your weekend? Mine was [share a small detail]! 👇\"\n",
            "    *   \"Plans for the upcoming weekend? I'm hoping to [share your plan]!\"\n",
            "2.  **Current Mood/Feeling:**\n",
            "    *   \"Feeling grateful for [something specific] today. What's one small thing that made you smile recently?\"\n",
            "    *   \"What's the one word that best describes your current mood? Mine is [word]!\"\n",
            "3.  **Recommendations/Advice:**\n",
            "    *   \"Looking for a new [book/movie/podcast/recipe/restaurant]! Drop your best recommendations below 👇.\"\n",
            "    *   \"Need some tips for [specific task/hobby, e.g., organizing, gardening, baking]. Share your wisdom!\"\n",
            "4.  **\"This or That\" / Quick Poll:**\n",
            "    *   \"Coffee or tea? ☕️ vs. 🍵 Let me know your pick!\"\n",
            "    *   \"Beach vacation or mountain retreat? 🏖️ vs. ⛰️\"\n",
            "5.  **Throwback/Nostalgia:**\n",
            "    *   \"Throwback to [year/event]! What's a favorite memory from that time?\" (Add an old photo!)\n",
            "    *   \"If you could go back and relive one day, which one would it be and why?\"\n",
            "6.  **Random Thought/Question:**\n",
            "    *   \"What's one small thing that instantly improves your day?\"\n",
            "    *   \"If you could have any superpower, what would it be and why?\"\n",
            "7.  **Sharing a Small Achievement:**\n",
            "    *   \"Just finished [small goal, e.g., a book, a workout, a project]! What's something you're proud of accomplishing lately?\"\n",
            "8.  **Pet/Child/Hobby Focus:**\n",
            "    *   \"Show me your furry (or scaled/feathery) friends! What's the funniest thing they've done lately?\"\n",
            "    *   \"Parents, what's one funny thing your kid said/did today?\"\n",
            "    *   \"What's a hobby you've picked up or revisited recently?\"\n",
            "\n",
            "---\n",
            "\n",
            "### II. Business & Brand Prompts (for Pages/Professionals)\n",
            "\n",
            "These are designed to engage your audience, build community, and promote your business without being overtly salesy.\n",
            "\n",
            "1.  **Audience Questions/Feedback:**\n",
            "    *   \"What's your biggest challenge when it comes to [your industry/product area]? Maybe we can help!\"\n",
            "    *   \"We're planning new [content/products/services]! What would you love to see more of from us?\"\n",
            "    *   \"If you could ask us anything, what would it be?\"\n",
            "2.  **Behind-the-Scenes:**\n",
            "    *   \"A peek into our [office/production process/team meeting]! What's one thing you're curious about behind the scenes?\"\n",
            "    *   \"Meet [Team Member's Name]! What's their favorite part about working here?\"\n",
            "3.  **Tips & Tricks (related to your niche):**\n",
            "    *   \"Quick tip for [relevant topic]: [Share a short, actionable tip]. What's *your* go-to tip?\"\n",
            "    *   \"What's one common misconception about [your industry/product]?\"\n",
            "4.  **Product/Service Engagement:**\n",
            "    *   \"Which of our [product/service] is your absolute favorite and why? We love hearing your stories!\"\n",
            "    *   \"If you could design a new [product/service] for us, what would it be?\"\n",
            "5.  **Industry News/Trends:**\n",
            "    *   \"What's one trend in [your industry] you're excited about (or worried about)?\"\n",
            "    *   \"What's the most surprising thing you've learned about [your industry] recently?\"\n",
            "6.  **\"Fill in the Blank\":**\n",
            "    *   \"When I think of [your brand/product], I think of ___________.\"\n",
            "    *   \"My favorite way to use [your product/service] is ___________.\"\n",
            "7.  **Polls & Quizzes:**\n",
            "    *   Use Facebook's poll feature: \"Which [option 1] or [option 2] do you prefer for [use case]?\"\n",
            "8.  **Customer Showcase:**\n",
            "    *   \"We love seeing how you use our [product/service]! Share your photos below or tag us!\"\n",
            "9.  **Ask for User-Generated Content (UGC):**\n",
            "    *   \"Show us your [product] in action! Post a photo/video in the comments.\"\n",
            "\n",
            "---\n",
            "\n",
            "### III. Call to Action (CTA) Prompts\n",
            "\n",
            "These are more direct, encouraging specific actions.\n",
            "\n",
            "1.  **Website Visit:**\n",
            "    *   \"Want to learn more about [topic]? Click the link in our bio/comments!\"\n",
