            "3.  **Purchase:**\n",
            "    *   \"Our [product/service] is now available! Shop here: [Link]\"\n",
            "    *   \"Limited time offer! Get [discount/bonus] on [product]. Grab yours before it's gone!\"\n",
            "4.  **Share/Tag:**\n",
            "    *   \"Tag a friend who needs to see this!\"\n",
            "    *   \"If you found this helpful, please share it with your network!\"\n",
            "5.  **Event RSVP:**\n",
            "    *   \"Join us for our upcoming [event type] on [date]! RSVP here: [Link to Event]\"\n",
            "\n",
            "---\n",
            "\n",
            "### Tips for Using Facebook Prompts Effectively:\n",
            "\n",
            "*   **Always include a visual:** A photo, video, or graphic will significantly increase engagement.\n",
            "*   **Keep it concise:** Get to the point quickly.\n",
            "*   **Use emojis:** They add personality and break up text.\n",
            "*   **Ask a question:** This is key for encouraging comments.\n",
            "*   **Be authentic:** Your audience can tell if you're genuine.\n",
            "*   **Respond to comments:** Foster conversation and build community.\n",
            "*   **Use relevant hashtags (sparingly):** 1-3 relevant hashtags can help with discoverability.\n",
            "*   **Vary your content:** Don't always use the same type of prompt.\n",
            "\n",
            "Choose a prompt that aligns with your current goal and audience!\n"
